OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 28 DEC
OL,4,G0800FRadcliffe and Maconie
OL,5,     GMark presents a feast of great
OL,6,     Gmusic and chat for weekend
OL,7,     Gbreakfast. With top tunes from
OL,8,     GKate Bush, Doves, Greentea Peng,
OL,9,     GTame Impala, Neneh Cherry and
OL,10,     GRadiohead.
OL,11,G1000FCerys Matthews
OL,12,     GCerys re-visits some of her
OL,13,     Gfavourite guests on the show from
OL,14,     Gthis year, including Yukimi,
OL,15,     GMartin Stewart, Neneh Cherry,
OL,16,     GPaul Wood, Angeline Ball, David
OL,17,     GCoulthard and Johhny Depp.
OL,18,G1300FGuy Garvey's Finest Hour
OL,19,     GGuy Garvey brings his own unique
OL,20,     Gtaste to 6 Music, and his best
OL,21,     Gmate Peter Jobson stops by for a
OL,22,     Gpost-Christmas catch-up.
